{
    "Dialogue": [
        {
            "text": "Don't you ever show your faces in Occidens.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 8,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "That was scary. Thank you very much. I would like to repay you, but I don't have anything to offer.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 22,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Don't worry about it. These guys have been causing problems for a while now. Anyway, we were about to have dinner. Would you like to join us?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 8,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "I'm starving! Also, could you tell me where we are?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 22,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "We are near Seafront village.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Seafront village? Are we in Occidens?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 22,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "How can you not know that?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 8,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Well, I fell asleep on my fishing boat, and when I came to, I was on the shore, with my boat nowhere to be seen.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 22,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "You survived a shipwreck while you were asleep? How lucky can you be?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "I don't think I'm that lucky... I was looking for food but all I found was this shiny rock...",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 22,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Is that an emerald?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 8,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "You can have it if you want, I don't really care. Let's eat! Then I feel like coming with you. You guys seem nice!",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 22,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Welcome aboard, I guess.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        }
    ]
}